{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc1e388a20f1be1c01ae82da4e376c4b83a5413acaf88c05814963edcba42f9d",
      "text": "二次聚会后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da8a1a106276b47266bfd31fc7659b282828ed6e48614d65afef4fbd5a5977a",
      "text": "再次向大家说一声，JAPAN IDOL FES辛苦了！\n……话说，这都是第几次说了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e92c679b44ebf1823df1d74fab016bbc4fa7c728b21575e7150bcafeafe5457",
      "text": "虽然我家里窄了点有点不好意思，但为了好好慰劳\n大家的奋战，接着享受三次聚会吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835e259d586a3e8c41754723ba555b83374b1a238f0b5535308202003fa19f24",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0a728d6234b5a6de5eb7eab270c49f2aa88a9d61d1a154e804528a5edcde59",
      "text": "……咕～，好喝！一想到明天休假就\n更好喝了！来，葛之叶你也喝啊喝啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d71c89aeeec3c7dfd601da7fd864b4e688eeaf447508d7ba641616759200df",
      "text": "承蒙款待了，山下先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b599c4b7eba1cf6ad03d6b4085ed47689308eb386c4158cf6d3beea7943fec7d",
      "text": "哈啊……我们竟然能登上新人偶像的龙门——JIF，\n而且还能把现场气氛炒得那么热烈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:276e3e62138d10d5316edf7208eea1fa370f724360a5b6fe26bb236ae1037724",
      "text": "那份热烈的盛况，坦白说也远远超出了\n我的预想。渡边君会激动得说不出话也是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec741d9265e031516ee99f0357f0214185ed316de95158475892a54d5cb121e",
      "text": "这是因为大家为了JIF，\n全心全意不断努力付出的结果哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6b1769aef361095b85007cfd81707a8da30e7ae160d888eebd372d7a2218c7",
      "text": "这样啊，确实呢……真高兴啊。\n希望能乘着这股势头，连结到下一次机会呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_g:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a7c0d7bea7a1eb39b3d8f8fb4ccd438deb160fa6de962b54b7b4c0a3fdd396",
      "text": "嗯。说到下一个目标，\n应该就是“男极ッ！偶像联盟”了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
